---
description: >-
  Every label and number form the highlighters colour (#498): a quoted
  `["…"]` label, a bare `[…]` label with blanks inside, signed and
  fractional sizes, a text node whose id is a number, and indented `text`
  lines that stay under their set across a blank line and a comment line.
---
venn-beta
  title Labels and sizes
  set A["Alpha"]:10
    text a1[First]

    %% still under A
    text 12
  set B[ spaced ]:+2.5
  union A,B[Both]:.5
    text "ab"["In both"]
  style A,B fill: #f00, stroke: rgb(1, 2, 3), color: rgba(0,0,0,0.5)
  text A t1
